@startuml UC28E_GuestBookingHistory
!theme plain
title UC28E: Lịch sử đặt phòng của khách

actor Staff as "Staff/Admin"
participant "Admin Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB

Staff -> Frontend: Chọn guest trong danh sách
Staff -> Frontend: Click "Xem lịch sử đặt phòng"
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/bookings\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(query params: guestIdNumber, guestPhoneNumber, guestEmail)

API -> API: Verify JWT + Check role (staff/admin)
API -> API: Build query filters\n(guests array chứa idNumber/phoneNumber/email)

API -> DB: Query bookings\n(filter: guests match criteria)\n(populate roomId, customerId, services)
DB --> API: Bookings list

API -> DB: Query service bookings\n(filter: bookingId in bookings list)
DB --> API: Service bookings list

API -> DB: Query invoices\n(filter: bookingId in bookings list)
DB --> API: Invoices list

API -> API: Aggregate booking history\n(bookings + service bookings + invoices)

API --> Frontend: Success + booking history\n(bookings, service bookings, invoices)
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị lịch sử đặt phòng\n(bookings, service bookings, invoices theo khách)
@enduml

